VERSION 2
RULE baseline.cpp.core.integer_overflow_or_wraparound VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "\\b(int|short|unsigned)\\s+\\w+\\s*=\\s*\\w+\\s*\\+\\s*(\\d{5,}|INT_MAX|UINT_MAX);" "im"
WHEN TEXT_MISSING "INT_MAX|UINT_MAX|__builtin_add_overflow|SafeAdd|checked_add|overflow|bounds" "im"
REPORT "Integer Overflow or Wraparound"
SEVERITY INFO
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
